{"id":"reference/Optionals","kind":"langref","title":"可选值","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Optionals","file":"reference/Optionals.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Optionals","text":"可选值"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Optional-Type","text":"可选类型"},{"depth":3,"slug":"null","text":"null"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Optional-Pointers","text":"可选指针"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Optionals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optionals\">可选值</a></h2>\n\n      <p>可选类型体现了 Zig 如何在不牺牲效率或可读性的前提下提供安全性。</p>\n      <p>问号表示可选类型。在一个类型前加问号，就能将其变为可选类型，例如：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">optional_integer.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// 普通整数</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> normal_int: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可选整数</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> optional_int: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5678</span>;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>现在变量 <code>optional_int</code> 可以是 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span></code>，也可以是 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code>。</p>\n      <p>下面暂不讨论整数，转而讨论指针。空引用是许多运行时异常的来源，甚至被指责为<a href=\"https://www.lucidchart.com/techblog/2015/08/31/the-worst-mistake-of-computer-science/\">计算机科学最严重的错误</a>。</p>\n      <p>Zig 没有这种空引用。</p>\n      <p>可以改用可选指针。它在底层会编译为普通指针，因为可以使用零表示可选类型的空值。与此同时，编译器会检查代码，确保不会将空值赋给不允许为空的对象。</p>\n      <p>不允许普通空值通常会使代码更冗长，但可以比较以下功能等价的 C 代码和 Zig 代码。</p>\n      <p>任务：调用 malloc，若结果为空，则返回空值。</p>\n      <p>C 代码</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">call_malloc_in_c.c</cite></figcaption><pre><code>// malloc prototype included for reference\nvoid *malloc(size_t size);\n\nstruct Foo *do_a_thing(void) {\n    char *ptr = malloc(1234);\n    if (!ptr) return NULL;\n    // ...\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>Zig 代码</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">call_malloc_from_zig.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// 列出 malloc 原型以供参考</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">malloc</span>(size: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) ?[*]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>() ?*Foo {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = malloc(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n    _ = ptr; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// ...</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>此处 Zig 至少与 C 同样方便，甚至可能更方便。此外，\"ptr\" 的类型为 <code>[*]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code>，<em>而不是</em> <code>?[*]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code>。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span></code> 关键字解包了可选类型，因此保证函数中所有使用 <code>ptr</code> 的位置都非空。</p>\n      <p>另一种常见的 NULL 检查写法如下：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"c-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">checking_null_in_c.c</cite></figcaption><pre><code>void do_a_thing(struct Foo *foo) {\n    // do some stuff\n\n    if (foo) {\n        do_something_with_foo(foo);\n    }\n\n    // do some stuff\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>在 Zig 中可以完成同样的操作：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">checking_null_in_zig.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doSomethingWithFoo</span>(foo: *Foo) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    _ = foo;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(optional_foo: ?*Foo) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 执行一些操作</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (optional_foo) |foo| {\n        doSomethingWithFoo(foo);\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 执行一些操作</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>再次注意，if 块内的 <code>foo</code> 已不再是可选指针，而是不能为 null 的普通指针。</p>\n      <p>这一点的好处是，可以为接收指针参数的函数标注 \"nonnull\" 属性，即 <a href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc-4.0.0/gcc/Function-Attributes.html\">GCC</a> 中的 <code>__attribute__((nonnull))</code>。知道指针参数不可能为空，有时能帮助优化器做出更好的决策。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Optional-Type\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Type\">可选类型</a></h3>\n\n      <p>在类型前加上 <code>?</code> 即可创建可选类型。可以使用编译时反射访问其子类型：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_optional_type.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"optional type\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 声明可选值，并从 null 强制转换：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> foo: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 从可选类型的子类型强制转换</span>\n    foo = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用编译时反射访问可选类型的子类型：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(foo)).optional.child);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_optional_type.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_optional_type.test.optional type...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"null\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#null\">null</a></h3>\n\n      <p>与 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#undefined\">undefined</a> 一样，<code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code> 具有自己的类型，只能通过转换为其他类型来使用：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">null.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> optional_value: ?<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Optional-Pointers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#Optional-Pointers\">可选指针</a></h3>\n\n      <p>可选指针保证与普通指针大小相同。可选值的 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">null</span></code> 保证表示地址零。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_optional_pointer.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"optional pointers\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 普通指针不能为 null。如需空指针，应使用可选前缀</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `?` 将指针类型变为可选类型。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ptr: ?*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">null</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    ptr = &amp;x;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, ptr.?.*);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可选指针与普通指针大小相同，因为使用指针值</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 零来表示空值。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@sizeOf</span>(?*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>), <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@sizeOf</span>(*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_optional_pointer.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_optional_pointer.test.optional pointers...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/while/#while-with-Optionals\">对可选值使用 while</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if-with-Optionals\">对可选值使用 if</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      ","translation":{"total":39,"translated":39}}
